  "description": "'Dong-i' a slave offered as the replacement sacrifice for the mountain deity that protects the village—\n\n\"S-Sir Tiger! Please don't eat me!\"\n\nFrightened by the mountain deity's appearance, thinking he would be captured and eaten, the deity suddenly becomes... a person?!\n\n**Notes:**  \n[*Tale of Hodong*](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=184913) is the seventh short story of series [*The Collected Short Stories Of Joseon Era*](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=182855).",
